# Generated per-episode media. The script (episodes/<id>/episode.json) is the
# source of truth. Raw ElevenLabs narration (narration.source.mp3), its
# alignment.json and narration.json may be committed to avoid paying for the
# same narration twice; everything derived from them is rebuilt on demand.
